<title>BELGIUM: Coil says Q1 1997 sales up 7.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Coil says Q1 1997 sales up 7.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian aluminium coatings company Coil, quoted on the  EURO.NM market, said on Friday its sales grew 7.5 percent to 146.1 million francs in the first quarter of this year compared with the last quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>This represented a rise of 18.3 percent against the first quarter of last year, it said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
